      "span": "Two versions of SIVAE are proposed: one captures the dependencies between the latent variables through a conditional prior network, and the other treats the latent variables independently such that syntactically-controlled sentence generation can be performed.",
      "concept": ["conditional prior network", "latent variables", "syntactically-controlled sentence generation"],
      "kind": "method"
    }
